    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/a2d3edb2a5c4474aaa7bf4235cd198b8"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/33ab1bbe425c44b9bd1278db8f58bb22"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/8a82e3e7b3f84318a43bbf4aadd96daf"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/a2d3edb2a5c4474aaa7bf4235cd198b8","stringItemText":"Non-invasive and non-destructive technology"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/33ab1bbe425c44b9bd1278db8f58bb22","stringItemText":"Concrete integrity testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/8a82e3e7b3f84318a43bbf4aadd96daf","stringItemText":"Rebar mapping"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/29282013ea8d49059d2191d3587c7419","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/29282013ea8d49059d2191d3587c7419","content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eOur teams are conducting important bridge investigations in Makhado Local Municipality this week.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/svpodhsa/whatsapp-image-2021-05-26-at-14-20-02-2.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eRoadlab teams are contributing to improvement projects in Limpopo\u0027s Makhado Local Municipality this week. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe will be performing concrete testing on 4 bridges around the Letaba, Xilovolo and Makhuvule rivers using non-invasive and non-destructive technology (NDT).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis will include testing the integrity of the concrete by locating cracks, voids, honeycombing, and other defects inside the structures. We will also be performing rebar mapping, allowing us to to determine the distribution of rebar inside the structures.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce our work is done, structural engineers will have the confidence to begin drafting plans to widen the roads that these bridges support.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/uhlhpo4q/whatsapp-image-2021-05-26-at-14-20-02-1.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/q4dibphk/20190812102734_img_9978.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/52vi2qq1/image1.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/g32lrn5o/whatsapp-image-2021-05-26-at-15-53-25.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/3wcopqvw/whatsapp-image-2021-05-26-at-15-53-24-1.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/t2dico0w/9-concrete-crack-width-meter.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/1k1l1g3t/image0.png\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/usmnrxjq/whatsapp-image-2021-05-26-at-14-20-02-3.jpeg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you need confidence in the integrity of your concrete works, reach out to us below.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of South Africa’s state enterprises, over 400 construction companies and more than 60 consulting firms.</p>]]></Value>
